{"error": false, "page": 4, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 4, "recordCount": 346, "data": [{"docid2": 1598411, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202012/t20201203_1598411.htm", "content": "\n　　11月29日，宁化县河龙乡林业站站长杨国群带领两名乡干部，前往下伊村巡山巡田，指导村民将稻秆进行无害化利用，制作有机肥。\n　　河龙乡地处闽赣边界，平均海拔597米，是全县平均海拔最高的乡。下伊村位于河龙乡", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202012/t20201203_1598411.htm", "docreltime": "2020.12.03 09:25:00", "doctitle": "宁化县河龙乡下伊村全力打好脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1688487, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202012/t20201203_1598411.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1595849, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201126_1595849.htm", "content": "  “我叫廖省华，80后，提起网名‘农二喜’，可能宁化人会更熟悉。”宁化县淮土镇禾坑村的廖省华说，他大学毕业后在泉州等地做服装设计，两年前回了家乡。“当时看到村里很多农产品卖不出去，而短视频带货又很火爆，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201126_1595849.htm", "docreltime": "2020.11.26 17:15:00", "doctitle": "80后小伙变身“李子柒”，回村创业带乡亲脱贫致富", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1684968, "sourcename": "现代快报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201126_1595849.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1591579, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201118_1591579.htm", "content": "\n　　在三明市清流县温郊乡桐坑村，9岁男孩黄子凌和姐姐遇上了困境：因为父亲病逝，母亲改嫁，奶奶的户口在他县，识别相对贫困户时户籍人口为2人，生活陷入了困境。 \n　　小康路上，不落下一个贫困群众。像黄子凌这样", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.11.18 10:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市探索创新农村相对贫困家庭“239”精准帮扶工作机制", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1702549, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1591003, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201117_1591003.htm", "content": "\n　　省扶贫开发协会、省扶贫基金会和省扶贫办、省社科联日前举办2020年脱贫攻坚典型经验交流会，我市一批先进集体和个人受到表彰。\n　　建宁、永安、明溪、清流、宁化5个县（市）扶贫开发协会获“扶贫开发先进集体”", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.11.17 10:12:00", "doctitle": "我市一批扶贫先进获省级表彰", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1702548, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1585111, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201104_1585111.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市审计局把打赢脱贫攻坚战作为重大政治任务来完成，摆上党组重要议事日程，注重扶贫审计与其他审计结合，开展全域扶贫领域审计，成效显著，为打赢脱贫攻坚战提交一份合格的审计答卷。截至目前，该局出具相关", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.11.04 08:13:00", "doctitle": "开展全域扶贫领域审计 助推打赢脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1679201, "sourcename": "三明市审计局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1584654, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202011/t20201103_1584654.htm", "content": "\n　　10月29日，三明市人防办主任张元江携副主任罗兴木、综合科科长林立平到建宁县客坊乡里源村走访慰问挂包贫困户，并带去了慰问金及慰问品。在深入走访慰问的过程中，两位领导分别与各自挂包的贫困户促膝交谈，详细", "docabstract": "市人防办领导深入走访慰问挂包贫困户", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "市人防办领导深入走访慰问挂包贫困户", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.11.03 09:52:00", "doctitle": "市人防办领导深入走访慰问挂包贫困户", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1702547, "sourcename": "三明市人防办网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1581493, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201023_1581493.htm", "content": "\n　　一是创新审计方式方法。坚持审计项目和审计组织方式“两统筹”，坚持全市审计“一盘棋”，实行“上审下”与“重点审计”相结合，扶贫审计与预算执行审计、经济责任审计、政策跟踪审计相协同，推进扶贫审计全覆盖", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.10.23 08:23:00", "doctitle": "三明市审计局2020年脱贫攻坚领域政策落实和资金使用审计取得显著成效", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1679200, "sourcename": "三明市审计局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1581347, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201022_1581347.htm", "content": "\n　　在市邮管局和明溪县政府的积极推动下，明溪县邮政分公司联合明溪县扶贫开发协会在明溪县欧侨广场，共同举办“爱心助农”扶贫农产品展销会。\n　　此次展销会展出的有温庄大米、硒锌猕猴桃、珍稀食用菌等几十款明", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.10.22 15:43:00", "doctitle": "邮政助扶贫  惠农进万家", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1679199, "sourcename": "三明市邮政管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1579830, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201019_1579830.htm", "content": "\n　　2020年是决胜全面建成小康社会、决战脱贫攻坚的收官之年，今年10月17日是我国第7个国家扶贫日，也是第28个国际消除贫困日。\n　　为深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于扶贫工作的重要论述，按照市委市政府关于推广农村", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201019_1579830.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.19 08:59:00", "doctitle": "我市开展2020年扶贫日农村相对贫困家庭精准帮扶主题志愿服务活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1665849, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201019_1579830.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1578082, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201012_1578082.htm", "content": " ——三明市探索创新农村相对贫困家庭“239”精准帮扶工作机制\n　　对于清流县温郊乡桐坑村10岁孩子黄子凌来说：父亲病逝，母亲改嫁，姐姐还未成年，奶奶户口落在外县，一家人生活陷入困境。\n　　黄子凌一家遇到的困", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201012_1578082.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.12 16:55:00", "doctitle": "加快小康“夹心层”脱贫致富步伐", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1663747, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201012_1578082.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1576601, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201009_1576601.htm", "content": "\n　　每逢村里圩天，泰宁县朱口镇神下村村民邱孝贤总是特别忙碌。这一天，为了给村民理发，他从早忙到晚。\n　　今年56岁的邱孝贤，因从小患有小儿麻痹症，导致肢体残疾。为了生计，在父母的支持下，他学习了理发手艺", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201009_1576601.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.09 09:53:00", "doctitle": "精准帮扶助“摘帽”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1662062, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/t20201009_1576601.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1575805, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575805.htm", "content": " 千亩桂花，万亩茶叶\n　　  冷泉叮咚，鱼儿欢畅\n　　       清流县林畲镇石下村通过产业带动，让资源变“资产”，家园变“花园”，走出了一条产业兴旺的乡村振兴之路。\n　　 9月23日下午14时，从澳洲鳕鱼现代产业园下", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575805.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.30 11:25:00", "doctitle": "兴产业，清流石下村走出独具特色振兴路", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1661195, "sourcename": "清流县融媒体中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575805.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1575790, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575790.htm", "content": "\n　　走进福建省三明市医保中心永安管理部办事大厅，墙上一面“急人所难、热情高效”的锦旗格外引人注目。这是前不久，待遇审核科的科长冯燕为疫情期间浙江返回永安的退休夫妇办理完业务后，老人对她的赞誉。\n　　锦", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575790.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.30 11:18:00", "doctitle": "福建三明：甘当贫困户的医保“管家”——记三明市医保中心冯燕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1661180, "sourcename": "国家医保局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575790.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "微信图片_20200930112025.jpg", "appdocid": 1575790, "appfile": "W020200930410081646103.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575790.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202009/W020200930/W020200930410081646103.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/W020200930410081646103.jpg"}, {"appdesc": "微信图片_20200930112120.jpg", "appdocid": 1575790, "appfile": "W020200930410082124182.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200930_1575790.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202009/W020200930/W020200930410082124182.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/W020200930410082124182.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/W020200930410081646103.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1573039, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573039.htm", "content": "\n　　9月25日，市委书记林兴禄深入永安调研，走访慰问贫困户。\n　　林兴禄来到青水畲族乡汀海村，与困难群众亲切交流，详细了解群众脱贫增收、子女教育、医疗帮扶等情况，并送上慰问物资，鼓励他们坚定信心、自力更生", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573039.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.25 21:13:00", "doctitle": "市领导赴永安市调研扶贫工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1658112, "sourcename": "三明市融媒体中心（记者：曾凤清/文）", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573039.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1573035, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573035.htm", "content": "   根据省扶贫开发领导小组印发的《关于开展全省脱贫攻坚质量调研的实施方案》（闽扶组〔2020〕7号）精神，我市各级各有关部门高度重视，狠抓落实，认真组织开展了脱贫攻坚质量自行评估工作。\n　　一是迅速安排部署。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573035.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.22 08:32:00", "doctitle": "我市开展脱贫攻坚质量自行评估工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1658108, "sourcename": "福建日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573035.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1573032, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573032.htm", "content": "\n　　2020年9月17日下午，市委副书记、市扶贫开发领导小组副组长王进足主持召开市扶贫开发领导小组2020年第三次会议。会议传达学习全国扶贫办主任座谈会和市委九届十三次会议有关精神，听取全市及各县（市、区）脱贫", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573032.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.17 19:39:00", "doctitle": "我市召开2020年脱贫攻坚第三次会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1658105, "sourcename": "福建日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/t20200925_1573032.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1564135, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202008/t20200827_1564135.htm", "content": "\n　　8月24日，市政府副市长郑剑波带领市农业农村局（扶贫办）、驻京联络处有关人员赴国务院扶贫办，专题汇报了三明扶贫改革试验区建设情况和全国（三明）扶贫改革试验区工作研讨活动筹备情况。国务院扶贫办政策法规", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.08.27 09:36:00", "doctitle": "市领导带队赴国务院扶贫办汇报三明国家扶贫改革试验区工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1652840, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1562283, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202008/t20200820_1562283.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市人防办积极响应习近平总书记提出的“看真贫、扶真贫、真扶贫”的重要指示，协调社会多方力量，真正把挂钩扶贫工作落到实处，为企业牵线搭桥做些公益事业献点爱心并进行了一次红色教育，为推动建宁县客坊乡", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.08.20 17:13:00", "doctitle": "市人防办协调社会多方力量做好挂钩扶贫创新工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1652839, "sourcename": "三明市人防办网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1553128, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202007/t20200723_1553128.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市人防办响应党中央号召，决战脱贫攻坚年,多点发力，精准施策，加大脱贫攻坚力度，争取资金和项目，出实招硬招实打实帮助贫困村纾困解难，脱贫攻坚取得实质性成效。\n　　三明市人防办挂钩贫困户三年来，办领", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.07.23 15:30:00", "doctitle": "多点精准帮扶 助力脱贫攻坚", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1639801, "sourcename": "三明市人防办网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1550215, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202007/t20200712_1550215.htm", "content": "\n　　7月3日，央视“时代楷模发布厅”播出“闽宁对口扶贫协作援宁群体”的先进事迹。我市广大干部群众认真收听、收看，纷纷热议。\n　　第八批三明援疆干部认真观看节目后，深受鼓舞，倍感振奋。“援宁干部是我们援疆", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.07.12 22:22:00", "doctitle": "我市干部群众热议“闽宁对口扶贫协作援宁群体”先进事迹", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1639797, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1548241, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202007/t20200707_1548241.htm", "content": "\n　　2020年以来，市、县（区）城乡居民保经办机构按照省、市工作部署，提高政治站位，不断加大工作力度，全力做好社保扶贫工作。截至6月底，全市应参保贫困人员总数60425人，已参保60425人，参保率达100%；应代缴贫", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.07.07 09:27:00", "doctitle": "三明市全面完成社保扶贫年度任务", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1639795, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1540987, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200615_1540987.htm", "content": "\n　　我市充分发挥保险政策对建档立卡贫困户发展农业产业项目的保障作用，激励其通过自身努力，因地制宜发展农业产业项目,帮助建档立卡贫困户实现稳定脱贫。截至6月7日，全市累计投保户（次）8731户，贫困户自缴保费", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200615_1540987.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.15 08:47:00", "doctitle": "农业产业扶贫保险助农脱贫", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1622573, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200615_1540987.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1540417, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200611_1540417.htm", "content": "\n　　一、基本情况\n　　三明市建宁县高峰村位于濉溪镇东部金铙山下，距县城10公里，全村共有183户873人，耕地663亩，林地21550亩，其中87%的林地划入国家闽江源自然保护区，人均耕地不足1亩。高峰村是革命老区基点村", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200611_1540417.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.10 09:20:00", "doctitle": "建宁高峰：香溪花谷助产业升级 乐动高峰促扶贫增收", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1621868, "sourcename": "建宁县政府网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200611_1540417.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1538693, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200605_1538693.htm", "content": "\n　　    为贯彻落实《三明市积极应对新冠肺炎疫情影响决战决胜脱贫攻坚七条措施》要求，确保高质量打赢脱贫攻坚战，近日，市财政局和市农业农村局下达2020年市级财政专项扶贫资金82.98万元。主要用于：一是支持无法", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200605_1538693.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.05 17:06:00", "doctitle": "我市下达市级财政专项扶贫资金82.98万元", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1619860, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200605_1538693.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1536546, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202006/t20200601_1536546.htm", "content": "\n　　“我们公司出产的黄金百香果成为唯一进入《三明市扶贫农特产品目录》的百香果，这对我们来说是天大的喜讯。施用生态肥，养鹅除草。我们的付出得到认可！”5月30日，从朋友处得知喜讯的三元区吉口仁村的果农张海", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.06.01 09:31:00", "doctitle": "我市工会节日慰问品优选扶贫农特产品", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1618636, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1535406, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200527_1535406.htm", "content": "     5月26日，市委召开脱贫攻坚集体约谈会，市委副书记王进足主持会议并讲话，市农业农村局局长王小坚传达贯彻全省脱贫攻坚工作推进会精神，并通报市对县成效考核情况和存在问题，12个县（市、区）表态发言。\n　　王", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200527_1535406.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.27 16:18:00", "doctitle": "我市召开脱贫攻坚集体约谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1616087, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200527_1535406.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1534351, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200526_1534351.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，我市开通“一键报贫”贫困农户在线申报系统和扶贫服务热线电话，全面受理贫困农户申报监测对象，将根据实际情况给予相关帮扶。 \n　　根据省扶贫开发领导小组印发的《关于建立防止返贫监测和帮扶机制的实施", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.05.26 08:35:00", "doctitle": "我市“一键报贫”系统开通", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1618631, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1531934, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200518_1531934.htm", "content": "\n　　市扶贫开发领导小组日前出台《三明市统筹推进医保扶贫四条措施》。\n　　对贫困人口转院转诊，实行“即时办”，由市医保局负责，建立“日日”监测管理机制，在医保信息系统增设贫困人口异地就医查询模块，由各县", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.05.18 09:23:00", "doctitle": "我市出台措施统筹推进医保扶贫", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1612191, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1530012, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200513_1530012.htm", "content": "     近日，我市举办脱贫攻坚综合业务培训班，12个县（市区）扶贫办副主任、股长、副股长或主要业务骨干、市扶贫科全体干部共计47人参加。会上，市扶贫科全体干部分别就国扶系统、一键报贫、扶贫资金管理、小额信贷和", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200513_1530012.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.13 15:03:00", "doctitle": "我市举办脱贫攻坚综合业务培训班", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1610084, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200513_1530012.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1529077, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200511_1529077.htm", "content": "\n　　5月8日，省卫健委党组成员、副主任陈辉到沙县调研健康扶贫和基层卫生工作。市卫健委党组书记、主任肖世宣,市卫健委党组成员、副主任茅声禄,副县长郭贤辉、县卫健局局长龚秋明等领导陪同调研。  \n　　调研组一行", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.05.11 11:20:00", "doctitle": "省卫健委领导到沙县调研健康扶贫和基层卫生工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1618282, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1529021, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202005/t20200511_1529021.htm", "content": "\n　　5月4日，宁化县泉上镇联群村贫困户黄木生与妻子李招妹甩动羊鞭，把关在3个羊圈里的150多只黄山羊分批赶往屋后山上。\n　　“山上的青草在夜里会沾上露水，山羊吃了容易拉肚子，必须等到太阳出来晒干后才可以吃。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.05.11 10:07:00", "doctitle": "小山羊“啃”出脱贫路", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1608961, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1527027, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200430_1527027.htm", "content": "\n　　4月25日至26日，市扶贫办组织召开三明国家扶贫改革试验区课题评审会议，邀请省扶贫办有关处室负责人及厦门大学、福建农林大学、省社科院、省农科院等有关专家，对《福建省三明国家扶贫改革试验区建设总体方案》", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200430_1527027.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.30 16:58:00", "doctitle": "我市完成三明国家扶贫改革试验区课题评审", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1606747, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200430_1527027.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "59f4a3483a87f8a28ad9dbb36a18c7a.jpg", "appdocid": 1527027, "appfile": "W020200430612577909905.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200430_1527027.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202004/W020200430/W020200430612577909905.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/W020200430612577909905.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/W020200430612577909905.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1526513, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200429_1526513.htm", "content": "     4月29日，省委办、省政府办发布公告，明确明溪、宁化、政和、连城、周宁、柘荣等6个县均达到脱贫退出条件，同意其退出省级扶贫开发工作重点县。至此，我市5个省级扶贫开发工作重点县全部“摘帽”，扶贫开发取得", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200429_1526513.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.29 15:33:00", "doctitle": "我市明溪、宁化两县退出省级扶贫开发工作重点县", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1606178, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200429_1526513.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1524082, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200422_1524082.htm", "content": "\n　　4月19日，宁化县治平畲族乡湖背角畲族村后山坡上，青山绿水间，一群群羽衣闪亮、体格健硕的河田鸡在林间悠闲地觅食、追逐嬉戏。山涧溪流潺潺，200多只鸭子逆流而上，“嘎嘎嘎”地闹个不停。\n　　“每天要随时巡", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200422_1524082.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.22 09:22:00", "doctitle": "生态鸡“啄”出致富路", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1603442, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/t20200422_1524082.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1481818, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481818.htm", "content": " 疫情防控期间，我市认真贯彻落实习近平总书记重要指示精神，坚持一手抓疫情防控，一手抓脱贫攻坚，做到“战疫”和“战贫”两不误，确保脱贫攻坚全面胜利、圆满收官。\n　　一是强化政策帮扶。民政方面，出台加大临时", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481818.htm", "docreltime": "2020.03.11 11:44:00", "doctitle": "我市强化“五个帮扶”打好疫情防控脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1560083, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481818.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1481242, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200310_1481242.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，习近平总书记在决战决胜脱贫攻坚座谈会上的重要讲话，在将乐、泰宁、建宁的广大党员干部中引发强烈反响。大家纷纷表示，要进一步提升责任感与使命感，巩固提升脱贫攻坚成果，着力夯实乡村振兴基础，推进", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.03.10 09:22:00", "doctitle": "夯实乡村振兴基础 坚决打赢脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1596611, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1479888, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200304_1479888.htm", "content": "\n　　疫情防控期间，我市认真贯彻落实习近平总书记重要指示精神，坚持一手抓疫情防控，一手抓脱贫攻坚，做到“战疫”和“战贫”两不误，确保脱贫攻坚全面胜利、圆满收官。\n　　一是强化政策帮扶。民政方面，出台加大", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.03.04 11:22:00", "doctitle": "我市强化“五个帮扶”打好疫情防控脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1596609, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1481797, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481797.htm", "content": " 2019年以来，盯紧脱贫攻坚目标任务，全面完成各项脱贫任务。全市5.46万名建档立卡贫困人口已全部脱贫，370个建档立卡贫困村、20个市级扶贫开发工作重点乡全部摘帽退出，明溪、宁化2个省级扶贫开发工作重点县达到摘帽", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481797.htm", "docreltime": "2020.02.29 11:23:00", "doctitle": "我市强化“三保障”提升脱贫攻坚实效", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1560062, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/t20200311_1481797.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202003/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1464502, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202001/t20200110_1464502.htm", "content": "     近日，市委办、市政府办发布公告指出，经乡级申请、县级审核和公示、市级部门实地评估检查等程序，清流县赖坊镇和宁化县方田乡等2个市级扶贫开发工作重点乡均达到脱贫退出条件，同意2个乡（镇）2019年度退出市级", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202001/t20200110_1464502.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.10 15:33:00", "doctitle": "我市2个乡（镇）退出市级扶贫开发工作重点乡", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1541066, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202001/t20200110_1464502.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/202001/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1459852, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201912/t20191227_1459852.htm", "content": "\n　　12月23日，位于漳州龙海市区的“龙海·泰宁精准扶贫平价超市”开业，吸引了不少当地居民前来采购。当天，超市销售额达10万元。\n　　从泰宁县扶贫办了解到，这个超市是全省首家县级精准扶贫超市，占地400多平方米", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.12.27 10:07:00", "doctitle": "全省首家县级精准扶贫超市开业", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1596608, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1375057, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201910/t20191025_1375057.htm", "content": "\n　　截至目前，全市共完成18489户53388人建档立卡贫困户脱贫措施核实采集，未发现“两不愁三保障”未保障的问题。在产业扶贫方面，选配贫困户产业发展指导员1865名，累计投入产业扶贫资金3889万元，落实产业扶贫措施", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.10.25 15:19:00", "doctitle": "我市建立稳定脱贫长效机制 基本实现“两不愁三保障”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1476630, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1349488, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201910/t20191017_1349488.htm", "content": "\n　　今年10月17日是我国第6个扶贫日，也是第27个国际消除贫困日。为深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于扶贫工作的重要论述，做好“四篇文章”、推进“四个着力”，广泛凝聚社会合力，共同助力城市扶贫，全面深化国家扶贫", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.10.17 15:03:00", "doctitle": "我市开展2019年扶贫日暨“社会扶贫 邀您一起”城市困难家庭精准帮扶主题志愿服务活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1476629, "sourcename": "三明市农业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1336165, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201909/t20190920_1336165.htm", "content": "\n　　为全面贯彻落实党中央、国务院脱贫攻坚决策部署，进一步加强和规范财政扶贫资金管理，确保资金安全，提高资金使用效益，福建省财政厅转发了财政部关于印发《财政部门财政扶贫资金违规管理责任追究办法》（下称《", "docabstract": "市财政局开展加强扶贫资金监管工作", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "市财政局开展加强扶贫资金监管工作", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.09.20 15:21:00", "doctitle": "市财政局开展加强扶贫资金监管工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1476628, "sourcename": "三明市财政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1321790, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201908/t20190804_1321790.htm", "content": "\n　　7月23日，市委办、市政府办联合发出公告，宣布明溪县枫溪乡等14个乡（镇）退出市级扶贫开发工作重点乡的行列，至此我市已有两批18个乡镇退出市级扶贫开发重点乡镇的行列。\n　　市委办、市政府办联合发布的公告说", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.08.04 20:14:00", "doctitle": "我市18个乡镇退出市级扶贫开发工作重点乡行列", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1393652, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1279635, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201904/t20190408_1279635.htm", "content": "\n　　4月4日，主题为“善意融情，心‘莲’心”的三明市“地产品+互联网+金融”扶贫项目启动仪式在建宁举办，市政府副市长张元明、建设银行福建分行副行长黄建锋出席活动。\n　　该扶贫项目依托建行善融商务电商平台，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.04.08 09:14:00", "doctitle": "我市“地产品+互联网+金融”扶贫项目在建宁启动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1347582, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1268274, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "乡村振兴信息", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/fp/xczxxx_27097/201902/t20190225_1268274.htm", "content": "\n　　2018年来，我市坚持将基础设施建设作为加快贫困地区发展的重要“引擎”，高起点谋划、全方位争取、大力度实施，最大限度地挖掘、整合、运用各方面的资源和力量，持续推进我市基础设施建设，增强农村发展后劲，不", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.02.25 11:27:00", "doctitle": "我市狠抓基础设施建设 夯实脱贫攻坚根基", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1335185, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "rels": []}]}